          place="Cemetery Hill (division re-formed), then left of the Eleventh Corps behind the batteries on the left of Cemetery Hill",
          when="Jul 1 about 17:00 (re-formed) and 'later in the evening' (moves left, builds breastworks); remains until about noon Jul 2",
